      "created_at": "2018-06-18T23:10:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello all, I just bought the game and read the rules.&nbsp; I haven't played yet.&nbsp; I did have a couple of questions which the FAQ addresses (thanks, Eric!), but couldn't find the answer to one:</p><p>One of the options to lower the difficulty even below the starting assumptions is to skip the initial Explore step during setup.&nbsp; But as near as I can tell from a reading, wouldn't that mean the spirits win instantly?&nbsp; Without that, there are no invaders of any type on the island, and at fear level 1, that's the win condition.&nbsp; What am I missing?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:24.272Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
